WEBVTT

00:03:27.320 --> 00:03:30.970
She thinks Al Gore 
is a really good-looking man.

00:03:30.970 --> 00:03:32.350
What do you say to a good-looking man?

00:03:32.350 --> 00:03:33.350
E: Hey, baby.

00:03:33.350 --> 00:03:35.000
(Laughter)

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:37.634
SW: And so do all the folks 
back home in Tennessee.

00:03:37.634 --> 00:03:39.000
E: Yee haw.

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:40.000
(Laughter)

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:42.000
SW: And since she's such a big fan,

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:44.500
she knows that his birthday 
is coming up at the end of March.

00:03:44.500 --> 00:03:46.310
And we didn't think he'd be in town then,

00:03:46.310 --> 00:03:49.000
so Einstein wanted to do 
something special for him.

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:52.000
So let's see if Einstein will sing 
"Happy Birthday" to Al Gore.

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:54.000
Can you sing "Happy Birthday" to him?

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:56.606
E: Happy birthday to you.

00:03:56.606 --> 00:03:57.900
SW: Again.

00:03:57.900 --> 00:03:59.630
E: Happy birthday to you.

00:03:59.630 --> 00:04:00.570
SW: Again.